#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:7
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Descripción general"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:9
msgid ""
"|morpheus| includes a built-in DNS resolver that provides internal DNS "
"management capabilities without requiring an external DNS server. The built-"
"in resolver supports full DNS record type management and can serve as the "
"primary DNS for |morpheus|-managed infrastructure or as a complementary "
"service alongside external DNS."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| incluye un integrado DNS resolver ese proporciona interno DNS "
"gestión capabilities sin requiring un externo DNS servidor. El integrado "
"resolver soporta completo DNS record tipo gestión y puede serve como el "
"primario DNS para |morpheus|-administrado infrastructure o como un "
"complementary servicio alongside externo DNS."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:11
msgid ""
"The built-in resolver is configured as an internal DNS integration type and "
"supports the complete set of standard DNS record types."
msgstr ""
"El integrado resolver está configurado como un interno DNS integration tipo "
"y soporta el completo establecer de estándar DNS record tipos."

