#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:155
msgid ""
"The built-in DNS resolver integrates with the |morpheus| provisioning "
"workflow:"
msgstr ""
"El integrado DNS resolver integrates con el |morpheus| provisioning "
"workflow:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:157
msgid ""
"**Automatic A Record Creation:** When an Instance is provisioned with an IP "
"assignment, an A record is created in the associated domain"
msgstr ""
"**Automatic A Record Creation:** Cuando un Instancia es aprovisionado con un"
" IP assignment, un Un record es creado en el associated domain"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:158
msgid ""
"**PTR Record Creation:** If a reverse zone exists for the IP range, a PTR "
"record is automatically created"
msgstr ""
"**PTR Record Creation:** Si un reverse zone existe para el IP range, un PTR "
"record es automáticamente creado"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:159
msgid ""
"**Record Cleanup:** DNS records are automatically removed when Instances are"
" terminated"
msgstr ""
"**Record Cleanup:** DNS records son automáticamente eliminado cuando "
"Instancias son terminated"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:160
msgid ""
"**Naming Policy Integration:** DNS records follow configured naming policies"
" for consistent naming"
msgstr ""
"**Naming Policy Integración:** DNS records seguir configurado naming "
"políticas para consistent naming"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:162
msgid "To enable automatic DNS for provisioning:"
msgstr "Para habilitar automático DNS para provisioning:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:164
