"Associate a domain with the built-in resolver in Infrastructure > Network > "
"Domains"
msgstr ""
"Associate un domain con el integrado resolver en Infraestructura > Red > "
"Dominios"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:165
msgid ""
"On the Cloud or Network configuration, select the domain for DNS assignment"
msgstr ""
"En el Nube o Red configuración, seleccionar el domain para DNS assignment"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:166
msgid ""
"Configure naming policies as needed (Administration > Provisioning > "
"Settings)"
msgstr ""
"Configure naming políticas según sea necesario (Administración > "
"Aprovisionamiento > Configuraciones)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:169
msgid "SOA Record Management"
msgstr "SOA Record Management"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:171
msgid "The SOA record for each zone is automatically managed:"
msgstr "El SOA record para cada zone es automáticamente administrado:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:173
msgid ""
"**Serial Number:** Auto-incremented on each zone change (YYYYMMDDNN format)"
msgstr ""
"**Serial Number:** Auto-incremented en cada zone cambiar (YYYYMMDDNN format)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:174
msgid "**Refresh Interval:** How often secondary servers check for updates"
msgstr ""
"**Refresh Interval:** Cómo a menudo secundario servidores verificar para "
"actualiza"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:175
msgid ""
"**Retry Interval:** How long secondary servers wait before retrying after a "
"failed refresh"
msgstr ""
"**Retry Interval:** Cómo largo secundario servidores wait antes de retrying "
"después de un falló refresh"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:176
msgid ""
"**Expire Time:** How long secondary servers serve data without a successful "
"refresh"
msgstr ""
"**Expire Time:** Cómo largo secundario servidores serve datos sin un "
"successful refresh"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:177
msgid "**Minimum TTL:** Default TTL for negative caching (NXDOMAIN responses)"
msgstr ""
"**Minimum TTL:** Predeterminado TTL para negative caching (NXDOMAIN "
"responses)"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:179
msgid "SOA parameters can be edited on the domain detail page."
msgstr "SOA parámetros se puede editar en el domain página de detalles."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:182
msgid "TSIG Authentication"
msgstr "TSIG Authentication"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:184
msgid ""
"TSIG (Transaction Signature) provides authentication for DNS operations:"
msgstr ""
"TSIG (Transaction Signature) proporciona autenticación para DNS operaciones:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:186
msgid ""
"**Zone Transfers:** Authenticate AXFR/IXFR requests between DNS servers"
msgstr ""
"**Zone Transfers:** Authenticate AXFR/IXFR solicitudes entre DNS servidores"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:187
msgid ""
"**Dynamic Updates:** Verify the identity of clients sending DNS updates"
msgstr ""
"**Dynamic Actualiza:** Verificar el identity de clientes sending DNS "
"actualiza"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:188
msgid ""
"**Algorithm Support:** HMAC-MD5, HMAC-SHA1, HMAC-SHA256, HMAC-SHA384, HMAC-"
"SHA512"
msgstr ""
"**Algorithm Support:** HMAC-MD5, HMAC-SHA1, HMAC-SHA256, HMAC-SHA384, HMAC-"
"SHA512"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:190
msgid "To configure TSIG:"
msgstr "Para configurar TSIG:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:192
msgid "Create a TSIG key record in the zone"
msgstr "Crear un TSIG clave record en el zone"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:193
msgid ""
"Configure both parties (sender and receiver) with the same key name, "
"algorithm, and secret"
msgstr ""
"Configure ambos parties (sender y receiver) con el mismo clave nombre, "
"algorithm, y secret"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:194
msgid ""
"DNS operations between authenticated parties will include TSIG signatures"
msgstr ""
"DNS operaciones entre authenticated parties será incluir TSIG signatures"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:197
msgid "Limitations"
msgstr "Limitaciones"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/dns/builtin_resolver.rst:199
